{"content_hash": "63bc1e63cfa2813c", "version_id": 622, "article_id": 63, "level_code": "en_a2", "lang": "en", "level": 2, "level_label": "A2 初级", "title": "Paramount to make a Cyberpunk 2077 movie", "title_zh": "派拉蒙要把《赛博朋克2077》拍成真人电影", "has_translation": true, "topic": "culture", "source": "bbc_culture", "source_url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c60e048r02lgo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1580617971627-cffa74e39d1d?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8N3x8dmlkZW8lMjBnYW1lJTIwY3liZXJwdW5rfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTE3NjYwNDJ8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Jezael Melgoza on Unsplash", "author": "Jezael Melgoza", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@jezar?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/people-sitting-on-chair-in-front-of-table-2xBb36ebevg?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(88, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(126, 46%, 48%)", "label": "CULTURE", "seed": "dbb883523716"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-12", "word_count": 149, "reading_minutes": 0.7, "lead": "The popular video game Cyberpunk 2077 will become a live-action movie. Paramount Pictures is working on it now. The game has sold over 40 million copies.", "lead_zh": "热门游戏《赛博朋克2077》要拍成真人电影了。派拉蒙影业正在做这件事。这款游戏已经卖出了超过4000万份。", "preview": "Paramount Pictures is making a live-action movie of the game Cyberpunk 2077. The studio is working with producer Lorenzo di Bonaventura and ", "preview_zh": "派拉蒙影业正在把游戏《赛博朋克2077》拍成真人电影。这家电影公司正在和制片人洛伦佐·迪·博纳文图拉以及游戏开发商CD Projekt Red合作。该公司表示对这次合作感到兴奋。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 610, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/63/en_a2.mp3", "duration": 64.736, "size_bytes": 392112, "engine": "edge-tts", "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural", "word_count": 168, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@fd8a8ee/content/data/versions/622.json", "paragraphs": ["Paramount Pictures is making a live-action movie of the game Cyberpunk 2077. The studio is working with producer Lorenzo di Bonaventura and the game's developer, CD Projekt Red. The company said it is excited about the partnership.", "The game came out in 2020 and had a difficult start. But it has sold more than 40 million copies. Keanu Reeves stars in the game as Johnny Silverhand. The story takes place in Night City, a dark future version of California.", "An expansion called Phantom Liberty came out in 2023. It stars Idris Elba and has sold over 15 million copies. Cyberpunk also became a popular animated series, Edgerunners. A second season will appear on Netflix this month.", "Many video games are becoming movies and TV shows. Super Mario, Minecraft and Sonic films each made about $1 billion. HBO's The Last of Us and Prime Video's Fallout were also big hits."], "paragraphs_zh": ["派拉蒙影业正在把游戏《赛博朋克2077》拍成真人电影。这家电影公司正在和制片人洛伦佐·迪·博纳文图拉以及游戏开发商CD Projekt Red合作。该公司表示对这次合作感到兴奋。", "这款游戏于2020年推出，起步艰难。但它已经卖出了超过4000万份。基努·里维斯在游戏中饰演强尼·银手。故事发生在夜之城，一个黑暗未来版的加利福尼亚。", "2023年推出了资料片《往日之影》。伊德瑞斯·艾尔巴参演，销量超过1500万份。《赛博朋克》还被改编成热门动画剧集《边缘行者》。第二季将于本月在Netflix上线。", "近年来许多电子游戏被改编成电影和电视剧。《超级马里奥》《我的世界》和《索尼克》电影每部都赚了约10亿美元。HBO的《最后生还者》和Prime Video的《辐射》也很受欢迎。"], "body": "Paramount Pictures is making a live-action movie of the game Cyberpunk 2077. The studio is working with producer Lorenzo di Bonaventura and the game's developer, CD Projekt Red. The company said it is excited about the partnership.\n\nThe game came out in 2020 and had a difficult start. But it has sold more than 40 million copies. Keanu Reeves stars in the game as Johnny Silverhand. The story takes place in Night City, a dark future version of California.\n\nAn expansion called Phantom Liberty came out in 2023. It stars Idris Elba and has sold over 15 million copies. Cyberpunk also became a popular animated series, Edgerunners. A second season will appear on Netflix this month.\n\nMany video games are becoming movies and TV shows. Super Mario, Minecraft and Sonic films each made about $1 billion. HBO's The Last of Us and Prime Video's Fallout were also big hits.", "body_zh": "派拉蒙影业正在把游戏《赛博朋克2077》拍成真人电影。这家电影公司正在和制片人洛伦佐·迪·博纳文图拉以及游戏开发商CD Projekt Red合作。该公司表示对这次合作感到兴奋。\n\n这款游戏于2020年推出，起步艰难。但它已经卖出了超过4000万份。基努·里维斯在游戏中饰演强尼·银手。故事发生在夜之城，一个黑暗未来版的加利福尼亚。\n\n2023年推出了资料片《往日之影》。伊德瑞斯·艾尔巴参演，销量超过1500万份。《赛博朋克》还被改编成热门动画剧集《边缘行者》。第二季将于本月在Netflix上线。\n\n近年来许多电子游戏被改编成电影和电视剧。《超级马里奥》《我的世界》和《索尼克》电影每部都赚了约10亿美元。HBO的《最后生还者》和Prime Video的《辐射》也很受欢迎。", "text": "Paramount Pictures is making a live-action movie of the game Cyberpunk 2077. The studio is working with producer Lorenzo di Bonaventura and the game's developer, CD Projekt Red. The company said it is excited about the partnership. The game came out in 2020 and had a difficult start. But it has sold more than 40 million copies. Keanu Reeves stars in the game as Johnny Silverhand. The story takes place in Night City, a dark future version of California. An expansion called Phantom Liberty came out in 2023. It stars Idris Elba and has sold over 15 million copies. Cyberpunk also became a popular animated series, Edgerunners. A second season will appear on Netflix this month. Many video games are becoming movies and TV shows. Super Mario, Minecraft and Sonic films each made about $1 billion. HBO's The Last of Us and Prime Video's Fallout were also big hits.", "vocab": [{"word": "live-action", "pos": "adj", "zh": "真人演的", "note": "指不是动画，由真人出演", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "studio", "pos": "noun", "zh": "电影公司", "note": "如派拉蒙、华纳等", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "developer", "pos": "noun", "zh": "开发商", "note": "这里指游戏开发公司", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "expansion", "pos": "noun", "zh": "资料片", "note": "游戏新增内容", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "copy", "pos": "noun", "zh": "份（销量单位）", "note": "卖出的游戏份数", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "animated series", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "动画剧集", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "adapt", "pos": "verb", "zh": "改编", "note": "把游戏改成电影或剧", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "box office", "pos": "noun", "zh": "票房", "note": "电影的收入", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "title_original": "Video game Cyberpunk 2077 to get live-action movie adaptation", "summary_original": "The smash hit from the studio behind The Witcher series is to be turned into a film by Paramount Pictures.", "body_original": "Video game Cyberpunk 2077 to get live-action movie adaptation\nBy\nTom Richardson\nBBC Newsbeat\nPublished\n9 October 2026\nA live-action movie version of smash hit video game Cyberpunk 2077 is being developed by Paramount Pictures.\nThe Hollywood studio is working with producer Lorenzo di Bonaventura, known for his work on the Transformers films, and CD Projekt Red (CDPR), the developer of the sci-fi role-playing game.\nCDPR's joint-chief executive Michał Nowakowski said in a statement\n,\nexternal\nthe company was \"excited about Paramount as a future partner who shares our creative ambitions for the Cyberpunk franchise\".\nDetails of the film's story, potential release date and casting information are yet to be revealed.\nDespite\na troubled launch in 2020\n, the Cyberpunk 2077 video game, which stars Keanu Reeves, has sold more than 40 million copies worldwide.\nThe John Wick star plays rockstar Johnny Silverhand, a terrorist whose consciousness is stored on a chip inside the body of main character V.\nSet in Night City, a fictional metropolis in a dystopian version of California, players work to uncover a conspiracy involving the shady Arasaka megacorporation.\nAn expansion, Phantom Liberty,\nstarring Idris Elba was released in 2023\nand has sold more than 15 million copies, according to CDPR.\nCyberpunk has already been successfully adapted into a popular animated series - Edgerunners - with a second season due to premiere on Netflix later this month.\nThe streamer also produced The Witcher, an adaptation of CDPR's massively popular fantasy role-playing series.\nIt originally starred former Superman actor Henry Cavill, but he was\nreplaced by Liam Hemsworth in the show's fourth season.\nMultiple video game series have been adapted for TV and film in recent years, with more due to follow.\nTwo Super Mario movies, a big screen version of Minecraft and a series of Sonic the Hedgehog films have each seen global box office takings of about $1bn.\nPlayStation game The Last of Us was made into a hit series by HBO, and Prime Video says its adaptation of post-apocalyptic role-playing series Fallout is one of its most-watched programmes.\nXbox maker Microsoft announced this week\n,\nexternal\nit had created a new \"XP\" division to focus on licensing its games for films, theme parks and other tie-ins.\nEarlier this week, Paramount Skydance completed\nits $110bn (£82.8bn) merger\nwith Warner Bros Discovery.\nIt's promised to release 30 films annually for the next two years, but also prompted\nfears over job losses and price rises for streaming services\nsuch as HBO Max and Paramount+.\nAdditional reporting by Peter Gillibrand.\nListen to Newsbeat\nlive\nat 12:45 and 17:45 weekdays - or listen back\nhere\n.\nRelated topics\nGaming", "fetched_at": "2026-10-12T00:47:20.989997", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "Paramount", "s": 0.1, "e": 0.675, "sm": 100, "em": 674, "cs": 0, "ce": 9, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "Pictures", "s": 0.688, "e": 1.175, "sm": 687, "em": 1175, "cs": 10, "ce": 18, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "is", "s": 1.188, "e": 1.312, "sm": 1187, "em": 1312, "cs": 19, "ce": 21, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "making", "s": 1.325, "e": 1.637, "sm": 1325, "em": 1637, "cs": 22, "ce": 28, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "a", "s": 1.65, "e": 1.7, "sm": 1650, "em": 1700, "cs": 29, "ce": 30, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "live-action", "s": 1.712, "e": 2.4, "sm": 1712, "em": 2400, "cs": 31, "ce": 42, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "movie", "s": 2.413, "e": 2.75, "sm": 2412, "em": 2750, "cs": 43, "ce": 4